body:
To the FOIA Officer, ${component_name} (${agency_name}):

Under the Freedom of Information Act, 5 U.S.C. 552, I request a copy of the existing FOIA request log or logs maintained by ${component_name} covering FOIA requests received from ${period_start_text} through ${period_end_text}.

By "FOIA request log" I mean any existing list, spreadsheet, database extract or report that the component already maintains to track FOIA requests. I am not asking you to create new records, compile statistics, or provide the agency's annual FOIA report. If they are maintained and releasable, please include for each logged request: ${field_list}.

This request does not seek the names, addresses or other contact details of individual requesters; you may omit those fields.

Please provide the records electronically (${delivery_format}) if they are readily reproducible in that form.

${fee_paragraph}

${requester_name}
${requester_block}
